  "headline_finding": "Executed faithfully against frozen v1 text (commit 9e0e460e3), but this Coordinator independently verified TWO severe design defects post-execution (CORR-20260831-d15d36): (1) the permutation p-value floor at n=200 draws (1/201) exceeds the tightest Holm-Bonferroni threshold (~0.0005) by ~10x, so the Stage-2 gate and Stage-3 zero-significant result were guaranteed regardless of the true effect size -- carries NO discriminating information; (2) the two curve families share primes pairwise by construction_ordinal (no `family` discriminator in the seed derivation), violating the panel's own independence claim and compromising the P5 enrichment comparison. Stage 0 and the dual-path convolution-engine agreement remain valid. K3/K4 remains open.",
